# Chuan hoa xuong dong.
#
# Repo nay build tren ca Windows (may admin) lan Linux (GitHub Actions).
# Neu de git tu doi CRLF/LF theo tung may, file zip build ra o hai noi se khac
# nhau va rat kho biet la khac that hay chi khac xuong dong.
#
# Quy uoc: trong kho luon la LF. Rieng file Windows chay truc tiep thi CRLF.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf

*.py   text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf

*.zip  binary
*.png  binary
*.blend binary
